{"seq":1,"slug":"vpc-peering-transit","title":"VPC 对等与 Transit Gateway","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/connectivity/vpc-peering-transit","wordCount":1564,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"vpc-对等与-transit-gateway\">VPC 对等与 Transit Gateway</h1><p>当一个组织的工作负载分布在多个 VPC 中时——无论是出于环境隔离（prod / staging / dev）、团队自治（不同业务单元独立 VPC）还是合规要求（数据本地化）——都需要在 VPC 之间建立网络连通性。VPC Peering 和 Transit Gateway 是两种根本不同的互联模型，选择错误会带来难以逆转的架构债务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>VPC Peering</strong>：两个 VPC 之间的点对点、不可传递的直接网络连接，延迟最低但管理复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>Transit Gateway（TGW）</strong>：区域级网络中转枢纽，支持 hub-and-spoke 拓扑和路由域隔离</li>\n<li><strong>路由表域（Route Table Domain）</strong>：TGW 内部的路由分段机制，实现 VPC 之间的选择性互通</li>\n<li><strong>AWS Cloud WAN</strong>：基于策略文档的全球广域网编排层，在 TGW 之上提供多区域自动化</li>\n<li><strong>VPC Lattice</strong>：应用层（L7）的服务间通信，绕过网络层互联直接按服务暴露</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"vpc-peering-基础模型\">VPC Peering 基础模型</h2><p>VPC Peering 是两个 VPC 之间的一对一网络连接。它在 AWS 网络骨干上建立直接的路由路径，不引入额外的网络跳点或带宽瓶颈。</p>\n<p>核心特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>VPC Peering 行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拓扑</td>\n<td>点对点，不可传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨区域</td>\n<td>支持（Inter-Region Peering）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨账户</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽</td>\n<td>无限制（和 VPC 内通信相同）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>最低——无中间跳点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CIDR 限制</td>\n<td>不允许重叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由控制</td>\n<td>每个 VPC 手动添加路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全组引用</td>\n<td>同区域支持跨 Peering 引用安全组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>不可传递性</strong>是 VPC Peering 最重要的约束。如果 VPC-A 对等 VPC-B，VPC-B 对等 VPC-C，VPC-A 并不能通过 VPC-B 到达 VPC-C。每一对需要通信的 VPC 都必须建立独立的 Peering 连接。</p>\n<p>这意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个 VPC 实现全互联需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N(N-1)}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.355em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 条 Peering 连接，以及相应数量的路由条目。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N &gt; 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 时，管理复杂度显著上升。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph Full-Mesh[&quot;全网格 Peering(N=4 → 6 条连接)&quot;]&#10;        A[VPC-A] --- B[VPC-B]&#10;        A --- C[VPC-C]&#10;        A --- D[VPC-D]&#10;        B --- C&#10;        B --- D&#10;        C --- D&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Hub-Spoke[&quot;Transit Gateway Hub-Spoke&quot;]&#10;        TGW((TGW))&#10;        E[VPC-A] --&gt; TGW&#10;        F[VPC-B] --&gt; TGW&#10;        G[VPC-C] --&gt; TGW&#10;        H[VPC-D] --&gt; TGW&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph Full-Mesh[\"全网格 Peering(N=4 → 6 条连接)\"]\n        A[VPC-A] --- B[VPC-B]\n        A --- C[VPC-C]\n        A --- D[VPC-D]\n        B --- C\n        B --- D\n        C --- D\n    end\n    subgraph Hub-Spoke[\"Transit Gateway Hub-Spoke\"]\n        TGW((TGW))\n        E[VPC-A] --&gt; TGW\n        F[VPC-B] --&gt; TGW\n        G[VPC-C] --&gt; TGW\n        H[VPC-D] --&gt; TGW\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"transit-gateway-架构\">Transit Gateway 架构</h2><p>AWS Transit Gateway（TGW）是一个区域级别的网络中转枢纽，充当所有连接的路由器。它支持连接 VPC、VPN、Direct Connect Gateway 和 peered TGW，最多可连接 5000 个 Attachment。</p>\n<p>TGW 引入了<strong>路由表域</strong>的概念：每个 Attachment 关联到一个路由表，路由表之间默认不互通。这支持了两种关键隔离模式：</p>\n<p><strong>共享服务模型</strong>：所有 VPC 都能访问共享服务 VPC（DNS、AD、监控），但生产和开发 VPC 之间不互通。</p>\n<p><strong>分段隔离模型</strong>：按业务线分段，每个段内 VPC 互通，段间仅通过安全设备互通（配合 Network Firewall）。</p>\n<p>TGW 路由表的路由传播机制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>VPC Attachment</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>propagation</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>TGW Route Table</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>association</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>VPC Route Table</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{VPC Attachment} \\xrightarrow{\\text{propagation}} \\text{TGW Route Table} \\xrightarrow{\\text{association}} \\text{VPC Route Table}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1005em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VPC Attachment</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0895em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagation</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1005em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TGW Route Table</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0895em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">association</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VPC Route Table</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个 VPC Attachment 可以向指定的 TGW 路由表传播自己的 CIDR。而 VPC 侧的路由表需要添加指向 TGW 的静态路由（或使用前缀列表）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"transit-gateway-vs-vpc-peering-决策矩阵\">Transit Gateway vs VPC Peering 决策矩阵</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2-3 个 VPC 全互联</td>\n<td>VPC Peering</td>\n<td>连接数少，延迟最低，无额外成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 10 个 VPC 互联</td>\n<td>Transit Gateway</td>\n<td>避免 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 连接爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要路由域隔离</td>\n<td>Transit Gateway</td>\n<td>Peering 不支持路由策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要集中安全检查</td>\n<td>Transit Gateway + Inspection VPC</td>\n<td>TGW 路由表可导流到防火墙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超高带宽低延迟（单对）</td>\n<td>VPC Peering</td>\n<td>TGW 引入约 0.1-0.5ms 额外延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨区域中转</td>\n<td>TGW Peering</td>\n<td>Inter-Region TGW Peering 支持中转路由</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成本对比：VPC Peering 仅收取跨 AZ/跨区域数据传输费，无连接费用。TGW 则有两层费用——每小时每 Attachment 的连接费 + 每 GB 数据处理费。对于大流量场景，TGW 的成本可能显著高于 Peering。</p>\n<h2 id=\"aws-cloud-wan-与-vpc-lattice\">AWS Cloud WAN 与 VPC Lattice</h2><p>2026 年的 AWS 网络生态中，TGW 之上出现了两个更高层的抽象：</p>\n<p><strong>AWS Cloud WAN</strong>：面向全球广域网的中心化编排。它在 TGW 之上提供策略驱动的全局连接——通过 Core Network Policy 文档（JSON）定义全球网络拓扑、路由策略和分段。Cloud WAN 自动在各区域部署 TGW 并建立 Inter-Region Peering。适用于在 10+ 个区域有业务的全球化组织。</p>\n<p><strong>AWS VPC Lattice</strong>：面向应用层的服务间通信。VPC Lattice 在 L7 层（HTTP/HTTPS/gRPC）解决服务发现和连接问题，完全绕过了传统的 VPC Peering / TGW 网络层。它的 Service Network 概念允许跨 VPC、跨账户的服务自动互联——无需管理 CIDR、路由表或安全组。2024 年底 GA 的 Resource Configuration 功能还支持连接 RDS 和任意 IP/域名目标。</p>\n<p>VPC Lattice 的出现标志着一个趋势：对于微服务间通信，应用层连接正在取代网络层连接。但 TGW 仍然是网络层基础设施互联（如共享服务、安全检查、混合连接）不可替代的组件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"azure-与-gcp-对比\">Azure 与 GCP 对比</h2><p><strong>Azure Virtual Network Peering</strong>：功能与 AWS VPC Peering 相似，但多了一个关键特性——<strong>允许网关传输</strong>（Allow Gateway Transit）。开启后，对等 VNet 可以使用对方的 VPN Gateway 访问本地网络，部分弥补了不可传递性的限制。</p>\n<p><strong>Azure Virtual WAN</strong>：等价于 AWS TGW + Cloud WAN。2026 年 3 月新增的 Virtual Network Manager 集成允许动态网络分组和连接策略编排。路由意图（Routing Intent）功能支持将所有流量强制经过 Hub 中的安全解决方案。</p>\n<p><strong>GCP VPC Network Peering</strong>：GCP VPC 本身是全局资源（子网跨区域），因此 VPC 数量天然更少。Peering 同样不可传递，但 GCP 通过 Shared VPC 模型（一个 Host Project 的 VPC 被多个 Service Project 共享）大幅减少了 Peering 需求。</p>\n<p>如何通过 PrivateLink 在不暴露整个网络的前提下安全地消费跨 VPC 服务，参见 <a href=\"private-link-endpoints\">PrivateLink 与服务端点</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>VPC 互联方案的选择是规模与复杂度的权衡：少量 VPC 用 Peering（低延迟、零额外成本），大规模多 VPC 用 Transit Gateway（集中路由、分段隔离），全球多区域用 Cloud WAN（策略驱动编排）。VPC Lattice 的出现标志着微服务间通信正从网络层互联向应用层服务发现演进——但 TGW 在基础设施互联和集中安全检查场景中仍不可替代。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"VPC 对等与 Transit Gateway","id":"vpc-对等与-transit-gateway"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"VPC Peering 基础模型","id":"vpc-peering-基础模型"},{"level":2,"text":"Transit Gateway 架构","id":"transit-gateway-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"Transit Gateway vs VPC Peering 决策矩阵","id":"transit-gateway-vs-vpc-peering-决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"AWS Cloud WAN 与 VPC Lattice","id":"aws-cloud-wan-与-vpc-lattice"},{"level":2,"text":"Azure 与 GCP 对比","id":"azure-与-gcp-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"安全组与网络 ACL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/vpc-fundamentals/security-groups-nacl"},"next":{"title":"PrivateLink 与服务端点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/connectivity/private-link-endpoints"}}